# Ignore everything by default, then explicitly allow the files
# that are safe to publish. This is intentional: new files must be
# opted in, so secrets can't leak in by accident.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!AGENTS.md
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.*
!*.sh
!docker-compose.example.yml
!.github/
!.github/**

# Never publish these — they contain real DigitalOcean API tokens.
docker-compose.yml
compose.yml
compose.yaml
bak.yml
*.env
.env*
